{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"attention-vs-rnn-sequence","content_sha256":"sha256:cd305983282fa365f0f82ef8540d0f378a3e211421005a86b99acce15a8c2ea7","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789959334.1668391,"domain":"model-architecture","explanation":"RNN 需按时间步串行且长程信息易衰减;自注意力任意位置直连(常数路径长度)并可并行,代价是 O(n^2) 复杂度且需额外位置编码。","id":"q-arch-mag6-attn-vs-rnn-023","options":[{"id":"a","text":"注意力可对整段序列并行计算,且任意两位置直接交互(路径长度 O(1)),更利于捕捉长程依赖与 GPU 并行训练"},{"id":"b","text":"注意力必须像 RNN 一样逐步串行,无法并行"},{"id":"c","text":"注意力的显存与序列长度无关,恒为常数"},{"id":"d","text":"注意力完全不需要位置信息,天然编码顺序"}],"prompt":"相比 RNN/LSTM,Transformer 自注意力在处理序列上的关键优势是什么?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"compare","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"Attention Is All You Need","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"attention","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
